02:17:56.723 --> 02:17:57.725
Exacto.

02:17:58.225 --> 02:17:59.185
Así es.

02:17:59.226 --> 02:18:00.728
Increíble.

02:18:01.144 --> 02:18:06.066
Ojala jamas hubieran pasado todas
